                                        <h3>Is WhatsApp Business API worth the cost?</h3>
                                        <p>For D2C / retail brands with 500+ monthly orders, yes. Payback is typically 2-6 months on cart recovery + broadcast alone.</p>
                                        <h3>Which platform is best — Wati, Interakt or AiSensy?</h3>
